{"ref":"BDB, אִלֵּם","hw":"אִלֵּם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אִלֵּם</span></big>  <strong>adj. dumb</strong>, unable to speak; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:11\" href=\"/Exodus.4.11\">Ex 4:11</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מִי שָׂם פֶּה לָֽאָדָם אוֹ מִי יָשׂוּם אִלֵּם</span>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 56:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.56.10\">Is 56:10</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּלָבִים אִלְּמִים</span> fig. of false proph.; of idols <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִילִים א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:18\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.18\">Hb 2:18</a>; as subst. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.8\">Pr 31:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:14\" href=\"/Psalms.38.14\">ψ 38:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.6\">Is 35:6</a>.","next":"BDB, אֻלָּם","prev":"BDB, אֵ֫לֶם"}